Z||000000||Jericko||08-23-2001||08:24 PM||||So it has been decided that my 4 cyl 2.5L 84 Fiero has a cracked piston ring, is it true that I need to get an "engine rebuild" or just a new engine...if this is the case, would it be a good idea for me to do an engine swap for something with more power, I dont want to spend too much money here.<P>Would you agree that I have a cracked piston ring if my car....<BR>Has enourmous amounts of smoke coming out of the exhasut, has absalutely NO power to it, it is next to impossible for it to accelorate, and it will stall if idelling in drive, in park it does not stall.<P>I just put a new exhaust system on it, is it possible that the people that installed my new muffler and tip can be held responsible, the new piping is 2¼" stainless steel piping, and its a magnaflow muffler???<P>Thanks Jericko<BR>112998411<BR>jericko@hobbiton.org <A HREF="http://jericko.hobbiton.org" TARGET=_blank>http://jericko.hobbiton.org</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000001||starfighter007@msn.com||08-23-2001||09:23 PM||||No I dont think the muffler people had anything to do with it .How many miles do you have on the motor?Are you looking to get a new rebuild junkyard motor ?If you decide to go with let say 2.8 v6 motors will probobly 300.00 different in price and I would say have about 300.00 an the side for incdentels.this of course is if you do the work yourself.Oh and if it were me with your problem Cracked ring I would have motor rebuilt rather than just replaceing one piston ring.but thats me Let us know||||reg||1
Z||000002||Fierowrecker||08-23-2001||09:59 PM||||Hey Jericko!<BR>How soon after the new exhaust system was installed, did the problem start???<BR>And did anyone at the shop "test drive" your car???<BR>crash...||||reg||1
Z||000003||ray b||08-24-2001||12:07 AM||||do a leak down test, like a compression test but with air pumped in to see what happens to it. bad ring will cause air to flow in to crankcase and out vent and you can hear it go. check cat if its pluged car won't run right. try a cheap fix first.||||reg||1
